; PepT2 (9BIS) + ampicillin in POPE/POPG bilayer, TIP3P water, KCl
; Protein: amber99sb-ildn | Ligand: GAFF (ACPYPE, AM1-BCC) | Lipids/ions: CHARMM-GUI-derived Amber-compatible includes
; Exactly one [ defaults ] section (from amber99sb-ildn.ff/forcefield.itp): 1 2 yes 0.5 0.8333

#include "amber99sb-ildn.ff/forcefield.itp"

; additional atom types / bonded types (no [ defaults ])
#include "toppar_lipid_ions.itp"
#include "AMP_atomtypes.itp"

; molecule types
#include "protein.itp"
#include "AMP.itp"
#include "POPE.itp"
#include "POPG.itp"
#include "amber99sb-ildn.ff/tip3p.itp"
#include "K+.itp"
#include "Cl-.itp"

[ system ]
PepT2-ampicillin in POPE:POPG (3:1) bilayer, TIP3P, 0.15 M KCl

[ molecules ]
; Compound        #mols
Protein_chain_A     1
AMP                 1
POPE              120
POPG               40
POPE              117
POPG               39
SOL         21456
K+               129
Cl-              58
